SQLI	SEC	CRITICAL	0.6	i	-	-	select,union,where	(union[ +]+(all[ +]+)?select|' *or *'?[0-9]+'? *= *'?[0-9]+|or[ +]+1=1|sleep\([0-9]+\)|benchmark\(|information_schema)
